相比差異較大，以致影響到數值的分佈狀況\n","\n","### 1. 檢查 Outliers 的流程與方法\n","* 查看每一個欄位的意義\n","* 檢查數值範圍(包含:平均數、標準差、中位數)\n","* 繪製散點圖(scatter)、分佈圖(histogram)、盒鬚圖(Box plot)等方式檢查\n","\n","### 2. 對 Outliers 的處理方法\n","* 刪除特徵\n","* 保留特徵：填補值(中位數、Min、Max、平均數)\n","* 另建特徵\n","\n","[Back to outline](#cp0)"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"scrolled":true,"id":"QAem3r9qtRKf","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":1000},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1617459655313,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":2284,"user":{"displayName":"北科大-張嘉芸","photoUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GhcM20C68MTH2x-G3yrqTq1HFjNhhYDEa_xSvay=s64","userId":"11213870514507527976"}},"outputId":"8ff90e63-2ed6-47e8-bc26-b70e4492f6a6"},"source":["# 繪製盒鬚圖，檢測離群值\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","for col in data.iloc[:,0:4]: #data.columns[0:4]\n","    plt.boxplot(x=data[col], sym =\"o\", whis = 1.5)\n","    plt.show()"],"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"image/png":"\n","text/plain":["<Figure size 432x288 with 1 Axes>"]},"metadata":{"tags":[],"needs_background":"light"}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"image/png":"\n","text/plain":["<Figure size 432x288 with 1 Axes>"]},"metadata":{"tags":[],"needs_background":"light"}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"image/png":"\n","text/plain":["<Figure size 432x288 with 1 Axes>"]},"metadata":{"tags":[],"needs_background":"light"}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"image/png":"\n","text/plain":["<Figure size 432x288 with 1 Axes>"]},"metadata":{"tags":[],"needs_background":"light"}}]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"DoMGnPv3tRKf","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1617459655314,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":2273,"user":{"displayName":"北科大-張嘉芸","photoUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GhcM20C68MTH2x-G3yrqTq1HFjNhhYDEa_xSvay=s64","userId":"11213870514507527976"}},"outputId":"997a49d1-b25f-4f33-cd05-e1ffcbfca7cf"},"source":["print('第25百分位數：',data['sepal length (cm)'].describe()['25%']) # 查看第25個百分位數\n","print('第50百分位數：',data['sepal length (cm)'].describe()['50%']) # 查看第50個百分位數\n","print('第75百分位數：',data['sepal length (cm)'].describe()['75%']) # 查看第75個百分位數"],"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","text":["第25百分位數： 5.025\n","第50百分位數： 5.7\n","第75百分位數： 6.4\n"],"name":"stdout"}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"mJExve6rtRKg"},"source":["---"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"_aaeSj4gtRKg"},"source":["<a id=\"cp4\"></a>\n","# 正規化(Normalization) / 標準化(Standardization)\n","\n","### 1. 正規化(又稱歸一化)\n","* x' = (x - x_min) / (x_max - x_min)\n","* 將數據縮放到(0,1)之間\n","* 將有量綱化為無量綱表達式，成為純量，有便於不同單位或量級的指標能夠進行比較\n","\n","### 2. 標準化\n","* x' = (x - μ)／σ\n","* 在機器學習中，我們可能要處理不同種類的資料，例如，音訊和圖片上像素值等高維度資料，資料標準化後會使每個特徵中的數值平均變為0(將每個特徵的值都減掉原始資料中該特徵的平均)、標準差變為1，\n","* 這個方法被廣泛的使用在許多機器學習算法中(例如：支持向量機、邏輯回歸和類神經網絡)\n","\n","### 3. 為什麼要正規化 / 標準化？\n","* 特徵間的單位（尺度)不同，比如身高和體重、攝氏度和華氏度、房屋面積和房間數，需消除特徵間單位和尺度差異的影響，以對每維特徵同等看待，需要對特徵進行正規化\n","* 正規化/標準化是一種線性變換，線性變換不會改變原始數據的數值排序，反而能提高數據表現\n","* 在使用梯度下降的方法求解最優化問題時， 歸一化/標準化後可以加快梯度下降的求解速度，即提升模型的收斂速度\n","\n","### 4. 什麼時候使用正規化？什麼時候使用標準化？\n","* 如果對輸出結果範圍有要求，用正規化。\n","* 如果數據較為穩定，不存在極端的最大最小值，用正規化。\n","* 如果數據存在異常值和較多噪音，使用標準化。\n","\n","[Back to outline](#cp0)\n","<br>https://www.jianshu.com/p/95a8f035c86c</br>"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"a-J33QqStRKg"},"source":["---"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"5HOtoOTltRKg"},"source":["<a id=\"cp5\"></a>\n","# 資料編碼(Encoding)\n","\n","### 1. Label encoding：把每個類別 mapping 到某個整數，不會增加新欄位"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"J6MyRYlatRKg","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":230},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1617459655705,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":2651,"user":{"displayName":"北科大-張嘉芸","photoUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GhcM20C68MTH2x-G3yrqTq1HFjNhhYDEa_xSvay=s64","userId":"11213870514507527976"}},"outputId":"556afece-475d-444d-cc3f-7276110fbfaf"},"source":["# 產生數據\n